{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>PDF Ultra 是一款為 iPhone 與 iPad 而設的 PDF 閱讀器，主打快速而優雅的閱讀與聆聽體驗，適合需要研讀教科書、審閱報告，或希望免持聆聽長篇文件的用戶。所有處理均在裝置本機完成，沒有廣告、無須註冊帳號，也不會追蹤或上傳檔案。原價 US $9.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>離線朗讀與手寫標註</h2>\n<p>內建日間、夜間與護眼模式，支援連續或單頁、垂直或水平捲動。朗讀功能配合鎖屏與控制中心操作，逐句高亮跟隨，速度與語音可調整。全文搜尋即時顯示結果數目，筆、螢光筆與擦膠標註直接寫入 PDF 並可移除。書庫設有繼續閱讀、收藏與書籤，並支援密碼保護檔案。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-48-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-49-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-50-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-51-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-52-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-53-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：PDF Ultra: PDF Reader &amp; Voice</li>\n<li>應用類別：Book</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T08:39:06.822456+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}